      "category": "Text",
      "text": "The Business Information Bureau will guide, help and inform people on where to go, what to do and how to do it. I have charged the Bureau with responsibility of getting quick action, and I direct all agencies under my jurisdiction, and request all others, to cooperate with the Department of Commerce and Industrial Development to achieve this goal.",
